/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 742 Tm (AcmeCorp Leave Policy) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 714 Tm (Owner: Human Resources) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Version 4, effective 1 January 2026) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686 Tm (Applies to: all employees) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 658 Tm (1. Purpose) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 640 Tm (This policy sets out the types of leave available to AcmeCorp employees, how much of) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (each an employee is entitled to, and how to request it.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 598 Tm (2. Annual leave) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 580 Tm (Full-time employees receive 25 days of paid annual leave per calendar year, in addition) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 566 Tm (to public holidays. Part-time employees receive a pro-rata share based on their) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 552 Tm (contracted hours.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 532 Tm (Employees who join during the year receive leave in proportion to the months remaining) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 518 Tm (in that year.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 498 Tm (Up to 5 unused days can be carried over into the next year. Carried-over days must be) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 484 Tm (taken by 31 March, after which they are lost. Leave is not paid out in place of being) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 470 Tm (taken, except when an employee leaves the company.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 442 Tm (3. Requesting annual leave) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 424 Tm (Requests are made in the HR portal and approved by the line manager.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 404 Tm (- Leave of up to 3 days needs at least 5 working days of notice.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 390 Tm (- Leave of more than 3 days needs at least 4 weeks of notice.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 376 Tm (- Managers should answer a request within 3 working days.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 356 Tm (A manager may refuse a request when too many people in the team are already away, but) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 342 Tm (must offer alternative dates.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 314 Tm (4. Sick leave) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 296 Tm (Employees receive up to 10 days of paid sick leave per year. An absence of more than 3) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 282 Tm (consecutive working days needs a note from a doctor. Employees should tell their manager) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 268 Tm (before their normal start time on the first day of absence.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 240 Tm (5. Parental leave) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 222 Tm (The primary caregiver receives 16 weeks of paid parental leave. The secondary caregiver) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 208 Tm (receives 4 weeks of paid leave, to be taken within 6 months of the birth or adoption.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 194 Tm (Employees should give 8 weeks of notice where possible.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 166 Tm (6. Bereavement leave) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 148 Tm (Employees receive 5 days of paid leave on the death of a close family member, and 1 day) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 134 Tm (for other relatives.) Tj
ET
